ance similar to an  angel her body would radiate light  enough to blind enemies in a wide radius  the intense light itself would make her  a tough opponent to fight against to be  fair no one would be able to defeat  historia and the only ones that would  even stand a chance would be the other  founding titan inheritors which won't be  possible as there can only be one  founding titan at a time still  theoretically considering the idea the  only person powerful enough to go  against her would be amir fritz as she  was the first ever titan and most likely  the strongest one who would have thought  that someone as pure and cute as astoria  would be this dangerous i guess that  punch to levi was a threat he should  consider historia was only the first one  there are still four more interesting  titans to cover so let's continue with  mikasa ackerman mikasa is pretty much  incomparable to other soldiers in terms  of stamina strength and 3d maneuvering  skills she is also remarkable in  hand-to-hand combat and would need a  titan that is also swift like her and  doesn't slow her down keeping this in  mind i think we can all agree that  mikasa would make a killer female titan  as we've seen in season 1 the female  titan doesn't possess any unique powers  and instead it relies on its incredible  endurance and user's own fighting skills  this titan is literally made for  ackermanns mikasa is already a very  overpowered character capable of  defeating many titans including some  titan shifters only using her 3d gear  just imagine how powerful she would be  with the power of the titans so how  would mikasa look in this form and what  abilities would she have in terms of  appearance similar to annie mikasa would  definitely have feminine yet muscular  body of the female titan but with black  medium-length hair additionally she  would also have purple eyes that give  her a more sinister look typically the  female titan's powers don't have much of  a twist to them however in mikasa's case  her attacks would be accompanied by  purple shockwaves and should be able to  reverberate those shockwaves throughout  to her opponent's body which would make  her punches and kicks way more  destructive and powerful furthermore  mikasa's pure strength combined with the  power of the titans will allow her to  destroy huge buildings and structures  with absolute ease although mikasa would  be an exceptional fighter and titan  holder there are some titans that she  would not be able to defeat like the  colossal titan and the founding titan  it'll just be impossible for her to  reach the nape of the colossal titan  without getting burned to a crisp the  only way she would be able to defeat the  holder of this power would be if someone  else exhausts him beforehand similar to  what armin and aaron did in the anime  three more titans are left and the next  one is everyone's favorite scout levi  ackerman even though he doesn't possess  any titan powers this man right here is  the most broken character in aot so how  strong would he be as a titan shifter as  levi is the most badass scout in the  survey corps it's only fair and natural  that he gets the coolest titan of them  all the warhammer titan levi would  retain some of his human features in  this form including his hair and height  sorry levi but you would still be short  even as a titan shifter furthermore levi  as the warhammer titan would be a treat  to watch as he would use it in ways  we've never seen before in the anime the  warhammer titan is capable of using its  flesh to create all sorts of weapons and  basically anything the inheritor wishes  so do you know what that means we would  get to see a titan version of levi with  the weapons of his choice that being his  two iconic swords additionally levi  would use his abilities to the max  creating traps of spikes and using a  whip to tie up an opponent or pull them  closer to him if he gets even more  creative with it he might be able to  create the 3d maneuvering of gear as  well but it would be challenging to  operate it considering the titan's  height and the fuel requirement as the  warhammer titan levi would not be as  fast as he is in his human form but he  would still be a very destructive  fighter due to his unpredictable  fighting style he'd be able to defeat  any titan shifter that comes in his path  even the colossal titan would not stand  a chance against him as levi would  definitely find a way to use his powers  and terrain around him to his advantage  before we explain sasha who is in my  opinion the most interesting one let's  first quickly cover erwin we all know  how irwin died at the end of season  three it was indeed a heart-wrenching  scene that left all of us feeling sad  however if levi stuck to his original  choice and decided to sacrifice armin  the next one in line for inheriting the  colossal titan was definitely irwin due  to this particular scene it's only  appropriate that in this video irwin  inherits the colossal titan as the god  of destruction he would look quite  similar to bertholdt and there wouldn't  be many changes to his appearance  however when it comes to his abilities  you can bet irwin would use them in the  best way possible much better than any  titan shifter before him he would use  the titan's destructive nature by  appearing in places where the enemies  least expect him he won't just use his  abilities during fights with other  titans but also to strategically weaken  his opponents by destroying their  harbors and main routes of escape  similar to what armin did in season 4  being the crazy gambler he is he'd  probably use his powers in the most  risky ways possible always putting  himself in danger for the sake of the  plan furthermore he would use the  scorching steam of the colossal titan to  keep himself safe from any kind of harm  and burn any enemies that come too close  since the colossal titan is already  extremely powerful he wouldn't really  have many